C:Music: traditional German, 1490 · Words: Attr. to King Gustavus Adolphus of Sweden (1594-1632), Jacob Fabricius (1593-1654) or Johann M. Altenburg (1584-1640). Translated by Catherine Winkworth, 1855
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Mehrstimmiges Choralbuch", 1906 Hymn 110. Translation from "Lyra Germanica", 1855 for St. Stephen's Day.. No second score was available to cross-check the melody.
